From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Simon Elsbrock <simon@iodev.org>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 10:52:43 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 108/111] ASoC: mediatek: mt8516: add the Amazon Echo Dot (3rd
 gen) machine driver

For the MT8516 Echos (ADR 0031). Playback goes from DL1 over I2S to the
TAS2770 speaker amplifier; the two TLV320ADC3101s share one TDM line
with four microphones; AWB loops DL1 back as the echo reference.

After lidar-mainline's driver for the Echo Plus (2nd gen) by LeagueRaINi
(GPL-2.0, commit db8242a), which has the same AFE paths and ADCs, without
its DAC, output switch and crossover. The links follow donut.c in
Amazon's Echo Dot (3rd gen) source release 6.5.7.1. Playback takes 16 and
24 bit samples: on the stock kernel the TAS2770 plays S24_LE and stays
silent on S32_LE (TECHO5). Not yet run on a Dot.
---
 sound/soc/mediatek/Kconfig                    |  13 +
 sound/soc/mediatek/mt8516/Makefile            |   3 +
 .../soc/mediatek/mt8516/mt8516-amazon-donut.c | 322 ++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 338 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 sound/soc/mediatek/mt8516/mt8516-amazon-donut.c

diff --git a/sound/soc/mediatek/Kconfig b/sound/soc/mediatek/Kconfig
index 97323b9a3..466d0bb2d 100644
--- a/sound/soc/mediatek/Kconfig
+++ b/sound/soc/mediatek/Kconfig
@@ -361,3 +361,16 @@ config SND_SOC_MT8516
 	  of the MediaTek MT8516 chip that can be used with other codecs.
 	  Select Y if you have such device.
 	  If unsure select "N".
+
+config SND_SOC_MT8516_AMAZON_DONUT
+	tristate "ASoC Audio driver for the MT8516 based Amazon Echo Dot (3rd gen)"
+	depends on SND_SOC_MT8516 && I2C && GPIOLIB
+	select SND_SOC_TAS2770
+	select SND_SOC_TLV320ADC3XXX
+	imply RESET_GPIO
+	help
+	  This adds support for ASoC machine driver for the Amazon Echo
+	  Dot (3rd generation), codename "donut", with a TAS2770 speaker
+	  amplifier and two TLV320ADC3101 microphone ADCs.
+	  Select Y if you have such device.
+	  If unsure select "N".
diff --git a/sound/soc/mediatek/mt8516/Makefile b/sound/soc/mediatek/mt8516/Makefile
index 752fbe0bf..be92f2205 100644
--- a/sound/soc/mediatek/mt8516/Makefile
+++ b/sound/soc/mediatek/mt8516/Makefile
@@ -6,3 +6,6 @@ snd-soc-mt8516-afe-y := \
 	mt8516-afe-pcm.o
 
 obj-$(CONFIG_SND_SOC_MT8516) += snd-soc-mt8516-afe.o
